              <div class="comp-test-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
              <p class="comp-test-text">"We compared Soundbox Store directly with Framery and the difference in value was staggering. Same acoustic performance, delivered in 3 weeks, at nearly half the price. Couldn't recommend more highly."</p>
