          <div class="comp-test-card" data-idx="1">
            <div class="comp-test-card-inner">
              <div class="comp-test-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
              <p class="comp-test-text">"After a long search for acoustic pods that didn't break the budget, we found Soundbox Store. The pods look stunning, the team was incredibly helpful, and they arrived faster than any competitor could promise."</p>
              <p class="comp-test-author">— Andrew Garwood Watkin, Office Manager</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
